1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,774
In this town, when the streetlamp turns red... freeze!

2
00:00:02,975 --> 00:00:05,215
Wait! It is glowing bright red right now!

3
00:00:05,315 --> 00:00:07,169
Don't move, Mox! Not even a muscle!

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,175
My left foot is itching so bad!

5
00:00:09,275 --> 00:00:11,405
Wait! Who is that walking past the bench?!

6
00:00:11,554 --> 00:00:13,685
Rules do not count if you have snacks.

7
00:00:13,835 --> 00:00:15,910
Why is the light flashing purple now?!

